##
#
# Steady flow over an inclined plane with Gauckler-Manning friction,
# Section 5.2.2 (Table 3) of [1]; "Example 1, Test 2" of Chertock et al.
# [2, Sec. 4.1].
#
# The topography is z(x) = -b x with b = 0.01 on the domain (0, 25) m. The
# unit discharge is q = q_0 = 0.1 m^2/s and the water depth is the constant
#
#   h_0 = (n^2 q_0^2 / b)^(3/10) = 0.095635 m,
#
# where n = 0.02 is the Manning coefficient. This state is an exact steady
# solution in which gravity balances friction. Dirichlet conditions are
# enforced at the left inflow boundary and "dynamic" (non-reflecting)
# conditions at the right outflow boundary. We run until T = 100 s with CFL
# 0.5 and report the normalized Linf errors of h and q (the consolidated
# error delta^inf of [1]).
#
# The chosen refinement level 9 corresponds to 513 Q1 degrees of freedom
# (first row of Table 3 of [1]); refinement 10 gives the second row (1025
# dofs). Table 3 is computed with RK(3,3;1) (erk 33) and RK(3,3;1/3) (ssprk
# 33). The errors are at the level of round-off and will differ in detail
# from the published values.
#
# [1] J.-L. Guermond, M. Maier, E. J. Tovar. A high-order explicit
#     Runge-Kutta approximation technique for the shallow water equations.
#     Computers & Fluids, 288:106493, 2025. arXiv:2403.17123
#
# [2] A. Chertock, S. Cui, A. Kurganov, T. Wu. Well-balanced positivity
#     preserving central-upwind scheme for the shallow water system with
#     friction terms. International Journal for Numerical Methods in
#     Fluids, 78(6):355-383, 2015.
#
##

subsection A - Scheduler
  set basename          = inclined_plane_friction

  set tasks             = error evaluation

  set final time        = 100
  set timer granularity = 100
end


subsection B - Equation
  set dimension                    = 1
  set equation                     = shallow water

  set gravity                      = 9.81
  set manning friction coefficient = 0.02

  set reference water depth        = 0.1
  set dry state relaxation small   = 1e2
  set dry state relaxation large   = 1e4
end


subsection C - Discretization
  set geometry            = rectangular domain
  set mesh refinement     = 9

  subsection rectangular domain
    set boundary condition left   = dirichlet
    set boundary condition right  = dynamic

    set position bottom left      = 0
    set position top right        = 25
  end
end


subsection E - InitialValues
  set configuration = sloping friction
  set direction     = 1
  set position      = 0

  subsection sloping friction
    set ramp slope        = 0.01
    set initial discharge = 0.1
  end
end


subsection H - TimeIntegrator
  set cfl min               = 0.50
  set cfl max               = 0.50
  set cfl recovery strategy = none
  set time stepping scheme  = erk 33
end


subsection K - ErrorEvaluation
  set error normalize  = true
  set error norms      = Linf
  set error quantities = h, m
end
